{{feat
|epic=yes
|type=general
|prereq=21st level, [[perform]] ''25'', [[bard song]]
|desc=This [[feat]] allows the effects of bardic music to last ten times longer.
|use=automatic
|icon=ife_x2lastinsp.gif
|bonus1=bard
|bonus2=Harper scout
}}

==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This feat [[stack]]s with [[lingering song]], but the former is applied first; so with both feats, the duration is 105 [[round]]s.
*The bard song requirement is specifically the level 20 bard song feat, so this feat cannot be taken with fewer bard levels (but can be taken at bard level 20).
*Because of the required [[perform]] level, this feat cannot actually be taken until [[character level]] 22.
*Only bards and [[Harper scout]]s can take the feat.

==Custom content notes==
*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.

